@model IReadOnlyList<AnnouncementListItemDto>
<div class="page-head"><div class="page-head__text"><h1>Announcements</h1><p>Company news and updates.</p></div></div>
@if (Model.Any())
{
    <div class="grid-2">
        @foreach (var a in Model)
        {
            <div class="card mb-0">
                <div class="card__body">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-2">
                        <h3 class="h5 mb-1"><a asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@a.Id">@a.Title</a></h3>
                        <span class="text-muted small text-nowrap">@Tz.ToLocal(a.PublishAtUtc ?? a.CreatedAtUtc).ToString("dd MMM yyyy")</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-muted small mb-2">Posted by @a.CreatedByName</div>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" asp-action="Details" asp-route-id="@a.Id">Read more</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
}
else
{
    <div class="card"><div class="card__body"><div class="empty"><i class="bi bi-megaphone"></i><h4>No announcements</h4><p>There is nothing to show right now.</p></div></div></div>
}
